# --- Thesis folder: ONLY the public, redacted PDF and the README are published.
# Everything else in thesis/ (the original .docx, source spreadsheets, business plans,
# working scripts) is confidential and must never be committed.
thesis/*
!thesis/README.md
!thesis/Master_Thesis_Milan_Stamenovic_public.pdf

# Spreadsheets and office documents anywhere in the repo
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xls
*.docx
*.doc

